&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt; looking for a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt; Product Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt; to join our team. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt; Product Manager &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;is responsible for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt; conveying the company’s security &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;strengths to customers, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt; and the market at large. This includes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;participating&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt; in relevant security &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;partnership initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;influencing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;security &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;positioning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt; and branding, and working closely with internal teams to ensure company’s security posture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt; and security products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt; is communicated effectively to all stakeholders. By combining &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt; in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;complia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;nce requirements with a customer-centric approach, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot;&gt; Product Manager helps position security as a competitive advantage rather than just an internal obligation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW150279474 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;1. Product Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define the vision and roadmap for Nebius’ security products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Owning the ideation, postmortem, prioritization, backlog, and customer feedback processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Guiding new features, systems and services from inception to launch, while keeping customers at the center of everything.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;2. Customer-facing communications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead public-facing communications around security updates or changes in compliance status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In the event of a security incident, coordinate user messaging (email notifications, press releases, FAQs) with support from the Head of Security Products and CISO.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Gather user feedback on user experience and security to guide continuous improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1440,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;3.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Competitive analysis and market research&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Conduct ongoing research on industry benchmarks, emerging security standards and technologies, and competitor certifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Identify gaps and opportunities in organization’s product security posture; propose strategic initiatives that differentiate the company’s security story in the market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Stay informed about new regulations or frameworks that may influence future product certifications or transparency requirements (e.g., privacy laws, data sovereignty standards).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1440,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;4. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Certification and audit support, service ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the CISO office to gather technical evidence or make necessary product enhancements that satisfy certification requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Take ownership of some security-related services of Cloud platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Track and maintain a certification roadmap (ISO 27001, SOC 2, HIPPA, etc.), working closely with CISO, GRC &amp;amp; Compliance, Corporate Security departments. Communicate timelines, goals and status updates to leadership and sales representatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;5. Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Coordinate with multiple Product Managers to align security goals with other product roadmaps, ensuring a consistent narrative between product security and external messaging.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with Platform Security, GRC &amp;amp; Corporate Security and legal teams to gather essential information for security products enhancements (e.g., penetration test summaries, compliance reports).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with Customer-facing teams to address client inquiries about security posture and guide them on using security features optimally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1800,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;3+ years of Product Management or Program Management experience with a focus on security initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Basic knowledge of compliance frameworks (e.g., SOC 2, ISO 27001, GDPR) and familiarity with how they translate into business value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proven ability to communicate technical concepts in a clear, customer-friendly manner (e.g., writing content, speaking at webinars or conferences).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Stakeholder management skills to align with other Product Managers, CISO staff, engineering, marketing, and customer-facing teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Analytical mindset: comfortable defining success metrics (e.g., security feature adoption, NPS around trust, certification progress) and making data-driven decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Project management skills: demonstrated ability to manage inter-team collaboration within company-wide projects, ensuring timely delivery of cross-functional tasks and alignment with compliance goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;It will be an added bonus if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Certifications such as CISSP, CISM, or PMP; prior experience in regulated industries; prior experience working for Cloud Service Provider.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nebius AI is an AI cloud platform with one of the largest GPU capacities in Europe. Launched in November 2023, the Nebius AI platform provides high-end, training-optimized infrastructure for AI practitioners. As an NVIDIA preferred cloud service provider, Nebius AI offers a variety of NVIDIA GPUs for training and inference, as well as a set of tools for efficient multi-node training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nebius AI owns a data center in Finland, built from the ground up by the company’s R&amp;amp;D team and showcasing our commitment to sustainability. The data center is home to ISEG, the most powerful commercially available supercomputer in Europe and the 16th most powerful globally (Top 500 list, November 2023).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nebius’s headquarters are in Amsterdam, Netherlands, with teams working out of R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe and the Middle East.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Nebius AI is built with the talent of more than 500 highly skilled engineers with a proven track record in developing sophisticated cloud and ML solutions and designing cutting-edge hardware. This allows all the layers of the Nebius AI cloud – from hardware to UI – to be built in-house, distictly differentiating Nebius AI from the majority of specialized clouds: Nebius customers get a true hyperscaler-cloud experience tailored for AI practitioners. We’re growing and expanding our products every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;If you’re up to the challenge and are excited about AI and ML as much as we are, join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Joblogic Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1998,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic&lt;/strong&gt; is the UK’s #1 &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Management&lt;/strong&gt; (FSM) software platform. We are a global business with offices in the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;. Since our management buy-out in 2013, we have grown from &lt;strong&gt;~£500K &lt;/strong&gt;ARR to &lt;strong&gt;~£35M+ &lt;/strong&gt;ARR and expanded our team from 11 to 500+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Product Director &lt;/strong&gt;to lead the strategy, vision, and execution of Joblogic&#39;s product portfolio across Field Service and Facilities Management. This is a senior leadership role for someone with &lt;strong&gt;broad product expertise, deep domain understanding, strong people leadership and mentoring skills, and a proven ability to design, build, and scale AI-powered products&lt;/strong&gt; in B2B SaaS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the product vision and roadmap across our entire FSM and CAFM platform, lead, grow, and mentor a high-performing product team, and partner with the executive team to translate market opportunity into commercial outcomes. You&#39;ll also be the driving force behind our AI-first product agenda — defining where AI delivers genuine value, embedding intelligence into core workflows, and ensuring we ship responsibly and at pace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, this is a people leadership role. You&#39;ll be the coach, mentor, and standard-setter for the product team — building careers, raising the craft bar, and creating the kind of environment where ambitious product people do their best work. You&#39;ll be equal parts strategist, people leader, and product craftsperson.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead product across the Joblogic platform, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end FSM and CAFM platform strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-first product initiatives — copilots, agents, predictive maintenance, intelligent scheduling, document intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reactive, PPM, and contract workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scheduling, dispatch, and optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field engineer mobile experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asset lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quoting → job → invoicing flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer portals and self-service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data, reporting, analytics, and embedded BI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vertical-specific FM workflows (HVAC, M&amp;amp;E, FM, building maintenance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform, integrations, and developer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;1. Set Product Vision &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and communicate a compelling 1–3 year product vision aligned to Joblogic&#39;s £100M ARR ambition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate market trends, customer insight, and competitive dynamics into a clear, prioritised portfolio roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sharp build / buy / partner / sunset decisions across the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the CEO, CPO, CTO, CRO, and CCO to align product strategy with commercial and GTM strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;2. Lead the AI-First Product Agenda&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Joblogic&#39;s AI product strategy across LLMs, ML, agents, and predictive analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the highest-value AI use cases across FSM and CAFM workflows — from intelligent scheduling and dynamic dispatch to predictive maintenance, automated quoting, and engineer copilots.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set principles for responsible, safe, and explainable AI — including data, privacy, evaluation, and human-in-the-loop design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close to the rapidly evolving AI landscape (foundation models, agentic patterns, RAG, fine-tuning, evals) and translate it into pragmatic product bets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineering and data leadership to shape the AI platform, data architecture, and ML lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;3. Mentor, Coach &amp;amp; Lead a High-Performing Product Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, mentor, and develop Product Managers, Senior PMs, and Group PMs across the portfolio — making people growth a core part of how you spend your week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run regular 1:1s, career conversations, and development plans tailored to each PM&#39;s strengths, goals, and growth areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach PMs through complex trade-offs, stakeholder management, difficult prioritisation calls, and high-stakes customer situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the standard for discovery, product craft, written communication, and commercial thinking — and actively raise the bar through feedback and pairing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear team structure, ownership, levelling, and career paths as the function scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong performance culture: clear expectations, candid feedback, recognition, and the courage to make hard people decisions when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a psychologically safe, inclusive environment where customer obsession, evidence-led decisions, and outcome ownership thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in the team&#39;s craft — running PRD reviews, discovery clinics, AI literacy sessions, and post-mortems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;4. Drive Discovery &amp;amp; Customer Insight at Scale&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed deep, continuous discovery across the product team — customer calls, field visits, usage analytics, and qualitative research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong personal connection to customers, engineers, planners, and contract managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesise insight across verticals to identify portfolio-level opportunities and risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion design partner programs and beta cohorts for new AI and platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;5. Partner With UX, Engineering &amp;amp; Data&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand-in-hand with Design and Engineering leadership to ship simple, scalable, beautifully crafted products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set quality bars for usability, performance, reliability, and AI behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure mobile and web experiences feel like one cohesive, modern product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a strong data and experimentation culture — from instrumentation to A/B testing to outcome reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;6. Own Commercial &amp;amp; Outcome Accountability&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own product-led inputs to ARR growth, retention, expansion, and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track product KPIs and OKRs at portfolio and team level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, CS, and Marketing on positioning, packaging, pricing, and launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent product externally — with customers, partners, analysts, investors, and at industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;7. Shape the Operating Model&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how product, design, and engineering work together — rituals, planning cadence, roadmap reviews, discovery operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale the function from a single-product mindset to a multi-product, platform-led operating model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve roadmap transparency, prioritisation frameworks, and cross-team dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Must-Have (Non-Negotiable)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extensive, proven experience in product management, including substantial experience directly managing and mentoring product managers&lt;/strong&gt; in B2B SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven &lt;strong&gt;people leadership and mentoring track record&lt;/strong&gt; — you&#39;ve built teams from the ground up, developed PMs into Senior PMs and beyond, and can point to specific people whose careers you&#39;ve helped shape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of shipping and scaling &lt;strong&gt;AI-powered products&lt;/strong&gt; — from problem framing through to production, evaluation, and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on understanding of &lt;strong&gt;modern AI/ML and GenAI capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;: LLMs, agents, RAG, evals, prompt and context engineering, model selection, fine-tuning, and ML lifecycle trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad product expertise across multiple domains — workflows, platform, mobile, data, integrations — and the ability to set strategy across all of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Field Service Management, Facilities Management, CAFM/CMMS, Construction Tech, or an adjacent vertical SaaS domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instinct: comfortable owning revenue-impacting decisions, pricing, packaging, and ROI cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success building, hiring, retaining, and growing product teams of 5–20+ people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent strategic communication — able to translate complex problems into clear narratives for the board, customers, and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Mentoring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural mentor — you genuinely enjoy growing other people and take pride in their wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at giving direct, kind, actionable feedback — and equally skilled at receiving it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable having hard conversations: performance, levelling, role changes, and tough prioritisation calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong emotional intelligence — you read teams well, spot burnout early, and create space for people to do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of hiring exceptional product talent and building diverse, inclusive teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to flex coaching style — from new PMs needing structure to senior PMs needing sounding-board sparring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Product &amp;amp; Leadership Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product craft: discovery, prioritisation, written specs, systems thinking, and outcome orientation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate at multiple altitudes — from 3-year strategy to specific PRDs and AI evaluation criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity, complex stakeholders, and competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data- and evidence-led decision making, balanced with strong product intuition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence without authority across executive, commercial, and technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling product in a PE-backed or high-growth SaaS environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to international expansion (Europe, North America).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in scheduling, optimisation, IoT, or operations research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching agentic or copilot experiences in B2B workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with APIs, marketplaces, and partner ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering, data science, or design background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joblogic is evolving from a traditional FSM tool into an AI-first, workflow-intelligent, vertical-focused platform — and the Product Director is the single most important hire in shaping that future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll directly influence:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How 100,000+ users experience Joblogic every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where and how AI shows up across the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How quickly we expand into CAFM and international markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The product culture, craft, and bar for the next 100 hires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our path from £25M to £100M ARR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to lead product at a scale where strategy, AI, and execution all matter — and where your decisions show up in the working day of thousands of engineers, planners, and service teams — this is the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Joblogic Values&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Joblogic, we expect our team members to champion and embed our core values across their work and customer interactions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respect – We value every individual and treat colleagues and customers with professionalism, fairness and empathy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Obsession with Customers – We place customer outcomes at the centre of everything we do, striving to deliver meaningful value and exceptional experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountability – We take ownership of our actions, decisions and results, holding ourselves and each other to high standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rethink Tomorrow – We embrace innovation, challenge the status quo and continuously improve how we work to shape a better future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOUT TIDE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we help SMEs save time and money in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions, from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market and now supports over 2 million members globally across the UK, India, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save time and money so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, Indian, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 million members: 900,000 UK and 1,100,000 in India and growing rapidly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2,800 Tideans globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised with Great Place to Work certification three years in a row, and among India’s Top 50 Best Workplaces in Banking, Financial Services, and Insurance in 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram, New Delhi, Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is hiring a VP of Engineering to lead the engineering organisation behind Ongoing Monitoring. You will report directly to the Chief Data and Technology Officer. Ongoing Monitoring protects our members by detecting fraud, financial crime and regulatory risk across every transaction Tide processes. The engineering, data science and platform capability behind it is one of the most technically demanding estates at Tide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be accountable for the engineering strategy, organisation and execution across all Ongoing Monitoring value streams: real-time transaction monitoring for bank payments fraud, acquiring fraud, Anti Money Laundering, Counter Terrorist Financing, sanctions and prohibited activities monitoring, and the tooling our financial investigators depend on. That means ML models in production, agentic AI inside regulated workflows, and multi-market screening infrastructure that stands up to regulatory scrutiny.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of regulated risk operations, near real-time platform engineering and applied AI. Our first line operations teams are the primary internal customer, our second line sets the risk appetite, and our regulators set the bar. We need someone who can raise detection quality and reduce fraud losses while driving the cost of monitoring per member down, and scale agentic solutions where a wrong answer has consequences for a member and for Tide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As VP Engineering, Ongoing Monitoring you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the engineering strategy for Tide&#39;s fraud, financial crime and ongoing monitoring platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead engineering across backend, frontend, data science, ML engineering and analytics engineering, primarily based in Hyderabad with product leadership split between Hyderabad and London&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead managers and senior engineers, and build the leadership bench underneath you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with multiple stakeholders across risk, operations, business, design, product and engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Decision Engine and Decision Intelligence Platform as shared capabilities, unifying domestic and international payment flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the model lifecycle end to end, from development through backtesting, shadow deployment and staged rollout to production performance monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale agentic AI in regulated workflows, including migrating Ongoing Monitoring agents onto Tide&#39;s shared agentic infrastructure and holding the line on our agentic governance framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver measurable risk and efficiency outcomes: lower fraud losses, higher automated alert throughput, and a falling ongoing monitoring cost per member&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the operating model that connects first line operations, second line risk and compliance, payments and acquiring engineering, KYX, AI Platforms and data science leadership behind one roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply principles so we build once, deploy globally, and keep market-specific logic isolated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is one of the most important engineering roles at Tide. Ongoing Monitoring is where we prove that trust scales, across every transaction we process. You will shape how quickly we protect our members, how confidently we enter new markets under our own licences, and how far applied AI can compound into a lasting advantage in a regulated environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading engineering organisations in fraud, financial crime, risk or another real-time decisioning domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of turning platform investment into measurable outcomes across fraud detection and mitigation, unit economics reduction and workflows automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking machine learning from development into production at scale, and owning model performance once live and fast iteration of model development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in a regulated environment, working with second line risk and compliance functions and with regulators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgement across organisation design, delivery, platform strategy, data architecture and technical quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead distributed teams across multiple markets and align several functions behind one roadmap, operating model and set of priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience deploying AI or agentic systems inside regulated workflows, with a clear view on governance, evaluation and human oversight would be a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET IN RETURN&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our location-specific employee benefits are designed to cater to the unique needs of Tideans:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Compensation –&amp;nbsp; Competitive salary and share options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Off – Generous annual leave on top of bank holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave – Maternity, paternity, and adoption leave to support your family journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical – Extended unpaid and paid leave options after completing milestone years with Tide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Insurance – Public health insurance plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Planning – Public pension scheme on eligible earnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DeutschlandTicket via Spendit - Employer funded free, unlimited travel throughout Germany on all local public transport (not valid in ICE, IC/EC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Urban Sports Club Membership - Employer funded M membership to help you live a healthy and active lifestyle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellbeing – Access to therapy sessions, courses, meditations, and workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering &amp;amp; Development Days – Paid days annually for volunteering or personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development – Annual budget for books, courses, coaching, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WOO (Work Outside the Office) – Work from abroad for up to 90 days annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Setup – Contribution towards setting up your home office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laptop Ownership – Keep your old laptop and get a new one when it’s time for a replacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TIDEAN WAYS OF WORKING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we champion a &lt;strong&gt;flexible workplace &lt;/strong&gt;model that&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;supports both in-person and remote work to cater to the specific needs of our different teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While remote work is supported, we believe in the power of face-to-face interactions to foster team spirit and collaboration. Our offices are designed as hubs for innovation and team-building, where we encourage regular in-person gatherings to foster a strong sense of community.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
