&lt;div&gt;• Fortune 500 or large enterprise new business sales experience in France or the Nordics&lt;br&gt;• Complex sales cycles including RFPs, POCs, and competitive bake-offs&lt;br&gt;• C-Level selling experience — you can navigate procurement, security, and legal complexity, including French enterprises (Orange, BNP Paribas, Société Générale, TotalEnergies, Sanofi, Capgemini, Dassault Systèmes, Thales) and Nordic enterprises (Ericsson, Nokia, Telia, Telenor, AstraZeneca, Spotify, Klarna, Equinor, Novo Nordisk, Maersk)&lt;br&gt;• Understanding of SIP trunking, phone number provisioning, carrier networks, or AI/ML platforms&lt;br&gt;• Established relationships in the Paris enterprise ecosystem — fintech, telecom, luxury/retail, aerospace/defense, healthcare, or SaaS&lt;br&gt;• Nordic language skills (Swedish, Danish, Norwegian, Finnish) for the Stockholm/Copenhagen/Oslo/Helsinki markets&lt;br&gt;• Experience selling across multiple European markets with different regulatory and procurement environments&lt;/div&gt;
